 lines+=['',f"Primary mean paired accuracy gain {pp(p['mean_accuracy_delta'])}pp; present-macro gain {pp(p['mean_present_macro_recall_delta'])}pp. Native_sourceBN descriptive mean accuracy gain {pp(s['paired_vs_native']['native_sourceBN']['mean_accuracy_delta'])}pp. This control does not change the primary method or establish isolated causality.",'', 'Fixed gate: mean accuracy gain≥0.5pp, at least5/8 strict user improvements, worst paired accuracy degradation≤2pp, tolerance1e−12. Positive and negative effects are retained regardless of the gate. User3 drops0.25pp; worst-user accuracy also drops from91.3333% to91.0833%. Report this limitation alongside the higher mean. No original contribution claim follows automatically from the gate.','', '## Training, reproduction and inference costs','', 'The phase raw ledger CPU measures training/replay/audit workers plus controllers/guards. Stage wall below derives same-boot worker startticks/HZ to waited completion, with kernel-tick/polling uncertainty; it excludes interfold idle periods. Training includes validation/checkpoint/output/sourceBN and passive collector work, not isolated gradient-only time. Standalone native-baseline runtime was not measured separately; both arms share a trajectory.','', '|Stage|Wall seconds|Local CPU seconds|','|---|---:|---:|']
